WNBC

WNBC 4 adalah stasiun televisi yang merupakan bagian dari NBC wilayah barat. Pernah dikenali sebagai WNBT dan WRCA.
WNBC dikenali karena bermarkas di Gedung GE, 30 Rockefeller Plaza, di New York. Diluncurkan pada tanggal 1 Juli 1941, saluran ini disiarkan lewat transmitter channel 4 UHF. To avoid channel interference with (WIVB-TV, also on channel 4).
To avoid channel interference with other stations on channel 4, like KRON-TV in San Francisco, KNBC in Los Angeles, KRNV in Northern Nevada, to protect KTVX as ABC, to avoid interference with KFQX and KCNC-TV.
WNBC was still on the same channel number as KMOV, a CBS station licensed to St. Louis. 
To do so, WNBC uses a similar antenna system on channel 4.1, to broadcast the station, and to avoid interference with WIVB-TV, a CBS affiliate on channel 4, and both stations are identical on the same frequency.
